## 🛠 Scaffold your project with CLI

Xeno includes an official CLI tool, `@xeno-js/cli`, designed to bootstrap your new application in seconds. It offers an interactive setup for Vue projects, instantly scaffolding the CQRS files, composables, and dependency injection boundaries.

```bash
# Generate a new Vue project
npx @xeno-js/cli new my-frontend-app --vue

# Generate a Vue Command with its Composable
npx @xeno-js/cli g command CreateUser --vue

```

Check the **[CLI Documentation](https://www.google.com/search?q=https://www.xeno-js.it/cli/overview&utm_source=gemini)** for full options.

